     * raja_yoga.kendra_trikona. all=true also lists every absent catalogue id with present:false.
     * Ids only, no text: planets sun..ketu, sign_index 0-based (Aries=0), house 1-based whole-sign
     * from the lagna, nakshatra index 0-based (Ashwini=0).
     *
     * Cost: 20 credits per call.
     *
     * Wire names: `houseSystem` -> `house_system`.
